  "long_description": "In The Room helps people get more out of the events they already attend. Connect it to your Eventbrite event and attendees can see who else is coming, pick out the people they want to meet, and keep the conversation going once the event is over. There’s nothing to download: everything works over email, text, and the web, with premium features in the app for people who want more. Organizers get a more engaged room, and sponsors get in front of an audience that showed up on purpose.",
